WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.590
- We always like to close out

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:03.840
with something to give
you all the good vibes.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:05.010
That's just how we do y'all.

00:00:05.010 --> 00:00:05.919
This is "What I'm liking."

00:00:05.919 --> 00:00:09.390
(upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:12.240
As you know, we just finished
up an amazing road trip.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:13.977
That's where I got to meet Mikayla.

00:00:13.977 --> 00:00:16.800
Now I want to tell you
about Tamara and Brandy,

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:18.855
moms and besties from Winterset, Iowa.

00:00:18.855 --> 00:00:20.490
For the past few years,

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:22.315
they've set out on an annual girl's trip,

00:00:22.315 --> 00:00:24.000
camping, hiking,

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:26.550
checking out sites off the
beaten path kind of vibe.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:29.087
This year they made their
journey extra memorable

00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:33.300
simply by giving their servers
along the way ginormous tips,

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.133
which is cool.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.880
We have these ladies on the line

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:39.690
watching on KCCI, Des Moines
now airing at 4:00 PM.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:41.423
It's so great to have you both here.

00:00:41.423 --> 00:00:42.792
(audience applauding)

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:43.842
- Hi!
- Hi!

00:00:43.842 --> 00:00:44.719
- [Kelly] Hi.

00:00:44.719 --> 00:00:46.511
So this is so cool,

00:00:46.511 --> 00:00:48.570
coming from a previous server,

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:49.471
I was a server,

00:00:49.471 --> 00:00:51.360
I know that all these
people appreciated it.

00:00:51.360 --> 00:00:52.282
How'd you come up with this idea?

00:00:52.282 --> 00:00:54.824
- Well, every year
Brandy and I take a trip

00:00:54.824 --> 00:00:58.925
and we went on our first
one to Northeast Iowa.

00:00:58.925 --> 00:01:02.250
We visited 13 waterfalls,

00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:06.720
we traveled 26 hours, 1300 miles

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:07.553
in one weekend,

00:01:07.553 --> 00:01:09.300
but had such a great time.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:10.707
The next year we went to Nebraska,

00:01:10.707 --> 00:01:14.419
the next year we decided to
head up to the U.P in Michigan.

00:01:14.419 --> 00:01:18.030
And then finally this last
year we went to Illinois.

00:01:18.030 --> 00:01:20.610
And we've both been servers before, too.

00:01:20.610 --> 00:01:24.510
Things don't always come
easy and we just decided

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.150
why not try to help
change someone's lives?

00:01:27.150 --> 00:01:30.120
So we painted this Venmo account

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.093
on the back of our car

00:01:31.093 --> 00:01:35.083
and opened a Facebook
page and it exploded.

00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:36.143
(Tamara chuckles)

00:01:36.143 --> 00:01:37.050
- I love that.

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:38.781
So wait, how did this servers react?

00:01:38.781 --> 00:01:40.410
- [Brandy] Well, they
would bring us our bill

00:01:40.410 --> 00:01:41.362
and we would fill it out

00:01:41.362 --> 00:01:43.500
and then we would flag them down

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:46.690
and say, "Hey we would like to
talk to you about our bill."

00:01:46.690 --> 00:01:48.000
And they would come over

00:01:48.000 --> 00:01:50.741
and just instantly be like,
"What? What is wrong?"

00:01:50.741 --> 00:01:53.322
And then they look at the
bill and they're like, "Whoa!

00:01:53.322 --> 00:01:55.890
What is going on here?" (chuckles)

00:01:55.890 --> 00:01:57.240
- [Tamara] Yeah, in our fourth night

00:01:57.240 --> 00:02:00.900
our server was a woman working four jobs

00:02:00.900 --> 00:02:02.417
trying to put herself through college.

00:02:02.417 --> 00:02:05.217
She was wanting to be a math
teacher and I'm a math teacher

00:02:05.217 --> 00:02:08.520
so it's near and dear to my heart.

00:02:08.520 --> 00:02:12.840
And so we gave her $985

00:02:12.840 --> 00:02:14.160
and then on top of that

00:02:14.160 --> 00:02:17.426
we surprised her with
$1000 worth of gift cards.

00:02:17.426 --> 00:02:19.890
And then the tears started falling.

00:02:19.890 --> 00:02:20.760
- For all of us.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:21.660
- Yes.
(Tamara chuckles)

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.590
- [Kelly] Oh my God, I know!

00:02:22.590 --> 00:02:25.701
I've seen the video and
I still cry every time.

00:02:25.701 --> 00:02:27.660
'Cause you just don't know how people

00:02:27.660 --> 00:02:29.460
you know, where they are in their lives

00:02:29.460 --> 00:02:32.310
and it can be really helpful
and it can turn things around.

00:02:32.310 --> 00:02:34.890
So it's a beautiful thing that
y'all are doing for people

00:02:34.890 --> 00:02:36.210
and you know, you've been servers,

00:02:36.210 --> 00:02:38.553
so you know it can be rough out there.

00:02:39.420 --> 00:02:40.980
But thank you so much, Tamara,

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:41.940
thank you so much, Brandy.

00:02:41.940 --> 00:02:44.079
I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:44.079 --> 00:02:44.912
(phone chimes)
(audience applauds)

00:02:44.912 --> 00:02:45.893
- [Tamara] Thank you, Kelly.
- [Brandy] Thank you.

00:02:46.920 --> 00:02:47.760
- [Kelly] And that's not all,

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:50.370
our season long partner,
Pilot pen makers of G2,

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:51.930
the go-to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:53.595
want to honor truly unstoppable

00:02:53.595 --> 00:02:56.100
and truly kind people just like y'all.

00:02:56.100 --> 00:02:59.250
So, they're gonna be writing
you a check for $1000

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:01.434
that you can use for your next road trip.

00:03:01.434 --> 00:03:03.128
Peem-peem-pee!

00:03:03.128 --> 00:03:05.820
- Oh my God! That's so generous.

00:03:05.820 --> 00:03:07.624
- [Kelly] Hey, keep
spreading that kindness,

00:03:07.624 --> 00:03:10.350
it really does, it makes
big ripples in the pond.

00:03:10.350 --> 00:03:11.640
So thank you so much, ladies.

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:13.140
Have a blessed night.
(audience applauding)

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:14.700
Thank you to all our guests today,

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.844
Elisabeth Moss, Noah
Cyrus, Mikayla Diante.

00:03:17.844 --> 00:03:19.020
Y'all have a great day

00:03:19.020 --> 00:03:21.093
and if it's not well, try and change it.

